! and defined. govax's LINK finds FTNRTL by itself; VMS's has to be told.
FTNRTL/SHAREABLE
$   IF F$SEARCH("ALTRETURNS.IN") .NES. "" THEN DEFINE/USER_MODE SYS$INPUT ALTRETURNS.IN
$   RUN ALTRETURNS
VALUE LESS THAN ZERO
VALUE EQUALS ZERO
VALUE MORE THAN ZERO
         -1 goes on
          0 goes on
          1 first
          2 second
          3 goes on
ROUGH first
IF first
IF goes on
IF not run
Left the loop at           3           3
INNER returned
INNER went on
GIVE   3.500000       2.500000    
GIVE goes on
FIRST   1.500000       4.500000    
FIRST first
LAST   6.500000       7.500000    
LAST first
To one label
ABCD           4
JOIN second
BARE goes on
